	PR tree-optimization/126504
	* match.pd ((CST1 << A) == CST2 -> A == ctz (CST2) - ctz (CST1)):
	If cand isn't representable in TREE_TYPE (@1), simplify to
	cmp == NE_EXPR.
	(((1 << n) & M) != 0 -> n == log2 (M)): Don't simplify if
	log2 doesn't fit into TREE_TYPE (@0).

